    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "tb-normalization-intro",
        "moduleId": "fd-concept",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "规范化的目的",
        "markdown": "教材指出，规范化（normalization）是解决关系模式异常的根本方法。其核心思想是通过模式分解，消除不合适的数据依赖，使每个关系模式描述单一主题。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000371"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据理论",
                "规范化"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6692,
              "lineEnd": 6703,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "141aa8fb007ece6bccf47a6ae71aa18504f9c3fff1df6c97a72c297dc931a7dc"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-fd",
        "moduleId": "fd-concept",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "函数依赖",
        "markdown": "教材定义：设 $R(U)$ 是一个属性集 $U$ 上的关系模式，$X$ 和 $Y$ 是 $U$ 的子集。若对于 $R(U)$ 的任意一个可能的关系 $r$，$r$ 中不可能存在两个元组在 $X$ 上的属性值相等而在 $Y$ 上的属性值不等，则称 $X$ 函数确定 $Y$ 或 $Y$ 函数依赖于 $X$，记作 $X \\rightarrow Y$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000372"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据理论",
                "函数依赖"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6704,
              "lineEnd": 6745,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "e8e1ee022b37febfa230450a02fbcae34d606984af5590821b789d7c9597b15b"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-fd-example",
        "moduleId": "fd-concept",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "函数依赖示例",
        "markdown": "例如，在学生关系中，若学号能唯一确定姓名和系别，则存在函数依赖：学号 $\\rightarrow$ 姓名，学号 $\\rightarrow$ 系别。但姓名通常不能唯一确定学号（存在重名），因此姓名 $\\nrightarrow$ 学号。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-fd"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-key",
        "moduleId": "fd-concept",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "码",
        "markdown": "教材定义：设 $K$ 为 $R<U,F>$ 中的属性或属性组合，若 $K \\stackrel{f}{\\rightarrow} U$，则 $K$ 为 $R$ 的候选码（candidate key）。若候选码多于一个，则选定其中一个为主码（primary key）。包含在任何一个候选码中的属性称为主属性，不包含在任何候选码中的属性称为非主属性。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000373"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据理论",
                "码 $^{①}$"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6746,
              "lineEnd": 6769,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "e2c2d0c3e089f5b94271b032be8b20368ad9149797ee9d4be1728b0473c1bd30"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-nf-intro",
        "moduleId": "normal-forms",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "范式概述",
        "markdown": "教材介绍，范式（normal form）是关系模式满足不同级别规范化要求的集合。各范式之间的联系为：$BCNF \\subset 3NF \\subset 2NF \\subset 1NF$。一个低一级范式的关系模式，通过模式分解可以转换为若干个高一级范式的关系模式的集合，这一过程称为规范化。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000374"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据理论",
                "范式"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6770,
              "lineEnd": 6789,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0002/images/8022f47cf76ce366707227ca7bf1d9776ec0f95a9c3d345f582d8bf5c81f6b0a.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "c57273ae906c847a7087788690070098faf8e8ae3ea07f2e19bf3b0c1ead3118"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-2nf",
        "moduleId": "normal-forms",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "2NF",
        "markdown": "教材定义：若 $R \\in 1NF$，且每一个非主属性完全函数依赖于任何一个候选码，则 $R \\in 2NF$。即2NF消除了非主属性对码的部分函数依赖。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000375"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据理论",
                "2NF"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6790,
              "lineEnd": 6823,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0002/images/e0ca5c9650c62c742041ca6451bac69fb5e8481a8f25f16e0817bd9a307a0a76.jpg",
                "parts/part-0002/images/a0d7ce189fa8933ca2b799a07461a2c2b02ae9daeeb839ab1868b149b6e296f8.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "feba70c7c8cb18e9297c1b1c075d8c72a2501ec40f5d7816ccc20084dbe3aa17"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-3nf",
        "moduleId": "normal-forms",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "3NF",
        "markdown": "教材定义：设关系模式 $R<U,F> \\in 1NF$，若 $R$ 中不存在这样的码 $X$、属性组 $Y$ 及非主属性 $Z$（$Y \\nrightarrow X$），使得 $X \\rightarrow Y$、$Y \\rightarrow Z$ 成立，则称 $R<U,F> \\in 3NF$。即3NF消除了非主属性对码的传递函数依赖。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000376"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据理论",
                "3NF"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6824,
              "lineEnd": 6835,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "148dd6dd9802f166012bb9a76e48310b669dd4d1df557124acb15d1fe8d52ce6"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-bcnf",
        "moduleId": "normal-forms",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "BCNF",
        "markdown": "教材定义：关系模式 $R<U,F> \\in 1NF$，若 $X \\rightarrow Y$ 且 $Y \\nsubseteq X$ 时 $X$ 必含有码，则 $R<U,F> \\in BCNF$。换言之，BCNF要求每一个决定因素都包含码，消除了主属性对码的部分和传递依赖。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000377"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据理论",
                "BCNF"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6836,
              "lineEnd": 6885,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0002/images/306419cdc00a1840597a85e473d108f138f2a92e86c78759ebb95e475ff0de8b.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "f437e92d88545c8db97c7f4991776574ffec2e53c34f4c1b5d837cf244ab852a"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-nf-ladder",
        "moduleId": "normal-forms",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "范式判定阶梯",
        "markdown": "可按照以下顺序快速判定：\n\n1. 检查是否满足1NF（属性原子、元组唯一）。\n2. 检查非主属性是否完全依赖于候选码，否则只满足1NF。\n3. 检查非主属性是否存在传递依赖，否则只满足2NF。\n4. 检查每一个决定因素是否都包含候选码，否则只满足3NF。\n5. 若以上均满足，则属于BCNF。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-2nf",
            "tb-3nf",
            "tb-bcnf"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-exercise",
        "moduleId": "application",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "判定与分解练习",
        "markdown": "【例】关系模式 $R$(学号, 课程号, 成绩, 系名, 系主任)，函数依赖集 $F = \\{$学号$\\rightarrow$系名, 系名$\\rightarrow$系主任, (学号,课程号)$\\rightarrow$成绩$\\}$。\n\n1. 求候选码：(学号, 课程号)。\n2. 判定范式：非主属性系名、系主任部分依赖于码，故不满足2NF，只满足1NF。\n3. 分解：将 $R$ 分解为 $R_1$(学号, 系名, 系主任) 和 $R_2$(学号, 课程号, 成绩)。$R_1$ 中传递依赖仍存在，继续分解为 $R_{11}$(学号, 系名) 和 $R_{12}$(系名, 系主任)，此时均满足BCNF。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-key",
            "tb-2nf",
            "tb-3nf",
            "tb-bcnf"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-mvd",
        "moduleId": "advanced-nf",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "多值依赖",
        "markdown": "教材定义：设 $R(U)$ 是属性集 $U$ 上的一个关系模式，$X$、$Y$、$Z$ 是 $U$ 的子集，并且 $Z = U - X - Y$。关系模式 $R(U)$ 中多值依赖 $X \\rightarrow\\rightarrow Y$ 成立，当且仅当对 $R(U)$ 的任一关系 $r$，给定的一对 $(x,z)$ 值，有一组 $Y$ 的值，这组值仅仅决定于 $x$ 值而与 $z$ 值无关。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000378"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关系数据理论",
                "多值依赖"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6886,
              "lineEnd": 6965,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0002/images/291ec9784f0b8aa35da2fdb8a4635ffcb0e674364dc464092fdd3e7bc76c3bd1.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "c624579918372f0c1ffac6207f68d064cfdfb2e70b6b44287cd766b4636ebf0b"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-4nf",
        "moduleId": "advanced-nf",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "4NF",
        "markdown": "教材定义：关系模式 $R<U,F> \\in 1NF$，如果对于 $R$ 的每个非平凡多值依赖 $X \\rightarrow\\rightarrow Y$（$Y \\nsubseteq X$），$X$ 都含有码，则称 $R<U,F> \\in 4NF$。4NF就是限制关系模式的属性之间不允许有非平凡且非函数依赖的多值依赖。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000379"
              ],
